change_type: instructions   changelog: - Updated API key check to provide clearer feedback and guidance for setting up CRAZYROUTER_API_KEY. - Changed usage examples to use tsx instead of bun for running scripts.

### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- echo "${CRAZYROUTER_API_KEY:-not_set}"
- npx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --input audio.mp3
- npx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --input meeting.m4a --output transcript.txt
- npx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --input chinese.mp3 --language zh
- npx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --input french.mp3 --translate
+ [ -n "${CRAZYROUTER_API_KEY}" ] && echo "key_present" || echo "not_set"
